         // Resolve the incoming chunk's subagent provenance before deciding whether
-        // to coalesce it into the previous assistant entry. qwen interleaves the
-        // parent agent's thoughts/messages with those of concurrently-running
-        // subagents; merging chunks across that boundary would splice unrelated
